    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relentless survival horror where every sound could be your last\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an abandoned building, you are being hunted. There is only one goal: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S-Project 66</strong> is not just another scientific experiment. It\u2019s a waking nightmare, a terrifying trial where every misstep could be fatal. Do you have what it takes to escape?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an <strong>independent musician</strong>. After a long day, you drift off to sleep\u2026 until a phone call suddenly jolts you awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your friend, panicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAre you still in there?! Tell me you made it out\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you haven\u2019t. You\u2019re still inside. And outside, there\u2019s only silence. A heavy, unnatural silence\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is lurking.</strong><br>Rumors speak of a <strong>cult</strong>, a <strong>serial killer</strong>\u2026 or worse, an <strong>unknown entity</strong>.<br>The hallways are empty, yet you feel a presence. You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hide. Escape\u2026 before it\u2019s too late.</strong></p>",
